/3104780/extras/5f63f2a23bbbaed16634b22c9c80c513.webm?t=1764593286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104780/extras/5f63f2a23bbbaed16634b22c9c80c513.mp4?t=1764593286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources after each battle and craft powerful items that significantly affect gameplay. Experiment with combinations and find item sets that help you take on even the toughest hordes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>10 Diverse Heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character offers:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unique abilities,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a distinct combat style,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >their own skill tree,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >different pacing and gameplay dynamics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the hero that perfectly fits your playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become the Greatest Warrior in the Cosmos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spaceborne Fighters offers a blend of fast-paced action, dynamic decision-making, and deep progression. Enter the arena, develop your skills, and overcome everything that stands in your way.</p>","developers":["Arkadia Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104780/header.jpg?t=1764593286","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3104780/892264173/9d79e4f69a72ad16e91a8f585e6f2ba36821941e/1750975170/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748086462","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3104780/892264173/9d79e4f69a72ad16e91a8f585e6f2ba36821941e/1750975170/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748086462","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailer